From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:29:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] The full invite shows in place

'See the full invite' opened the public ?rsvp= link in a new tab, which shows
the SAVED invite (Classic while the host had picked At a glance), and the
440px preview window cut off the reply buttons. The button now opens the same
preview to the whole draft invite, in place, and toggles back (Show less).

New spec: e2e/theFullInviteShowsInPlace.spec.mjs (all 7 projects). The
invite specs (theHostChoosesTheInvite, theInviteWearsItsColors) still pass:
112 passed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AvdmPMBVcZtcxNoy5hTjAV
